---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Puzzle from '../lib/puzzle.md';
---

<Base
	title="Puzzle"
	description="A little puzzle hidden on va3ndf.com. Solve it and say hello."
>
	<header class="page-head">
		<p class="label">Puzzle</p>
		<h1>Hey — glad you found me.</h1>
	</header>

	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			If you worked out my little puzzle, I can just about guarantee we'd get along. Let me
			know you solved it: <a href="mailto:solved@va3ndf.com">solved@va3ndf.com</a>.
		</p>

		<Puzzle />

		<p>
			Maybe we've got more in common. Have a look at the <a href="/blog">writing</a> for
			homelabbing, amateur radio, emulators, and the rest — or the
			<a href="/builds">builds</a> if you'd rather look at pictures.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>

<style>
	.page-head {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 2vw, 2.25rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin-top: 0.3rem;
	}
</style>
